quired tiles and colors:\n\n- (2,0): You give me a B  \n- (3,2): You give me a B  \n- (1,0): I give you an R  \n- (3,0): I give you an R  \n\nIf you agree, reply “agree” and we’ll finalise. If you want to increase the transaction (cover more tiles), we can discuss, but I require at least these two R tiles covered. \n, \nplayer 0: Your contract aligns perfectly with my needs. Covering (2,0) and (3,2) with B chips from you is essential for me to reach my goal; covering (1,0) and (3,0) with R chips for you is a fair and mirrored exchange, and does not leave me worse off.\n\nI have no incentive to ask for or give more coverage at this stage, as it does not strictly increase my score.\n\nConfirming the agreed contract:\n\n- (2,0): You give me a B  \n- (3,2): You give me a B  \n- (1,0): I give you an R  \n- (3,0): I give you an R  \n\nagree \n, \nplayer 1: Turn: 2: agree \n",
